Data quality
The use of tablets with a CAPI programme to collect
data and check electronically the inconsistencies that
may occur during the capture of responses and to
avoid mandatory data gaps. Data quality assurance
mechanisms were established at all levels (national,
county, SA, and EA) involving various actors and the
logical validation rules found in the CAPI. A dashboard
was developed to monitor the quality of data that
was synched onto the cloud server. Several quality
indicators were developed by the Technical Team and
were incorporated into the dashboard to monitor the
quality of data at the EA and district levels as sent to
the servers.
